{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Battle for Burgers Begins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3010Synopsis\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cheerful man excitedly arrives at a popular burger shop in town. However, it turns out to be a terrifying facility controlled by the evil Emperor &quot;Pattypatine&quot;! Ravenous, rampaging burgers are everywhere... Fight back with the shining fries, the &quot;Potato Saber&quot;!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight with Potatoes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield your Potato Saber and slice through evil! Master parrying and dodging to navigate battles skillfully.<strong>You can eat when you're hungry.</strong> Get ready for intense, greasy-handed combat!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use the Moos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moos: The power residing in all objects. Use it to pull or lift distant items to solve puzzles! Is it faster to just use your hands? ...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An Emotional Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, mysteries unfold, and the protagonist's past is revealed. What kind of ending awaits? This game is designed for 1-2 hours of playtime. The story is self-contained with no branching paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Regarding Videos and Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playthrough videos and streaming are welcome. Please confirm the following two points:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please include the game's name in the title (required).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please include the Steam store page URL in the description (optional).<strong></strong><br><br> <strong></strong><br> </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648240?t=1753198263","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648240?t=1753198263","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/